      "text": "specific heat capacity of water = $4.2\\,\\text{J K}^{-1}\\text{g}^{-1}$"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Which expression can be used to calculate the enthalpy of combustion of ethanol in $\\text{kJ mol}^{-1}$?"
